   "roundness": null,
   "text": "the idea brief OR the problem statement \u00b7 its killer assumption \u00b7\nand a viability SIGNAL \u2014 never a verdict. testing it is this rung's job.\n  IDEA     \u2014 is the need real, and can we win?\n  PROBLEM  \u2014 is the cause correctly located, and is closing the gap\n             worth what it costs?",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "the idea brief OR the problem statement \u00b7 its killer assumption \u00b7\nand a viability SIGNAL \u2014 never a verdict. testing it is this rung's job.\n  IDEA     \u2014 is the need real, and can we win?\n  PROBLEM  \u2014 is the cause correctly located, and is closing the gap\n             worth what it costs?",
   "autoResize": true,
