   "roundness": null,
   "text": "UNQUALIFIED is the dangerous one, and it is\ndangerous because it does not look dangerous.\na named, unsized risk READS AS MANAGED \u2014 it has\na name, it is written down, it looks handled.\nthe failure mode is not silence. it is false comfort.",
